<title>USA: Casio Computer, SkyTel in wireless pact.</title>
<headline>Casio Computer, SkyTel in wireless pact.</headline>
<dateline>JACKSON, Miss. 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Casio Computer Co Ltd and SkyTel Corp, a subsidiary of Mobile Telecommunication Technologies Corp, have agreed to develop and market SkyTel 2-Way wireless messaging applications for Casio mobile information devices, the companies said Monday.</p>
<p>No further terms of the deal were disclosed.</p>
<p>The companies said in a joint staement that they expected their relationship to grow stronger as they jointly develop wireless messaging applications.</p>
</text>
